            "text": "<p>I've had my QuestProps for almost 2 weeks. It took me a few tries to find the right position, but now I look forward to my 10 minutes of luxurious relaxation every night! I'm amazed at the points it's able to hit and the release of tension that is immediate. I'm very happy with my purchase.  ☺️</p>",
