            "heading": "26° Support",
            "text": "<h3><strong>26° SUPPORT</strong></h3><p><strong>A position designed to let you settle in.</strong></p><p>Neck Restore is built around a 26° supported angle to help keep the device comfortably positioned during your 10-minute routine.</p><p>No constant repositioning.<br/><br/>No holding it in place.<br/><br/>Just settle in and let the routine begin.<br/></p>",
