          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/38c3047fc18b260fd16e378384fb10f2.jpg",
            "heading": "Heat",
            "text": "<h3><strong>COMFORTABLE HEAT</strong></h3><p><strong>Warmth that makes it easier to slow down.</strong></p><p>Gentle heat adds a comfortable layer to your 10-minute reset — especially after a long day of sitting, driving or working.</p><p>Just choose your setting and let the warmth become part of the routine.<br/><br/></p>",
