          "type": "profile",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/d7e7ddbccc6b9f330136575a0f775c6a.jpg",
            "heading": "Massage",
            "text": "<p><strong>Hands-free massage, without the work.</strong></p><p>Built-in massage adds a soothing physical sensation while you sit back and let the 10-minute routine run.</p><p>No holding.<br/><br/>No reaching behind your neck.<br/><br/>No complicated technique</p>",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "color_background": "#171717"
          }
        },
        "profile_TkHdAz": {
          "type": "profile",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/c611bd6b5cd2abacfd1a61826cf3f8be.jpg",
            "heading": "Gentle EMS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>GENTLE EMS</strong></h3><p><strong>A subtle pulse to complement your reset.</strong></p><p>Gentle electrical stimulation adds another layer to the Neck Restore experience, designed to complement heat and massage during your 10-minute routine.</p><p>Choose your preferred intensity and let the device do the work.</p>",
